+Integration notes: wire preflight into LangChain runtime
+
+1) Ensure services are deployed:
+   - moderation service -> MODERATION_SVC (default http://moderation:8080)
+   - verifier service   -> VERIFIER_SVC (default http://verifier:8080)
+   - pii service        -> PII_SVC (default http://pii:8080)
+
+2) The chain run flow should:
+   - perform retrieval (use langchain_runtime/rag_retriever)
+   - generate output using LLM
+   - call run_preflight(model_id, model_version, input_text, generated_output, retrieved_docs, options)
+   - if preflight returns allow==True, return preflight.output (may be redacted)
+   - if preflight returns pending==True, return a pending response and log approval_id to client
+
+Example pseudo-call (inside your chain runner):
+
+from .preflight import run_preflight
+docs = retrieve(query)
+output = llm_generate(query, docs)
+pf = run_preflight(model_id, model_version, query, output, docs)
+if pf.get("allow"):
+    return pf.get("output")
+if pf.get("pending"):
+    return {"status":"pending","approval_id":pf.get("approval_id"), "reason":pf.get("reason")}
